e g\u0142\u00f3wne role w filmie \"Totalna magia 2\", powracaj\u0105 do \u015bwiata nocnych intryg, snutych przy \u015bwietle ksi\u0119\u017cyca, oraz pot\u0119\u017cnej, dziedziczonej po przodkach magii. Tym razem siostry Owens musz\u0105 stawi\u0107 czo\u0142a mrocznej kl\u0105twie, gro\u017c\u0105cej ostatecznym rozpadem ich rodziny. Ten film to pozycja obowi\u0105zkowa, pe\u0142na humoru, magii i chaosu.<\/span><\/font><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\">Gatunek: Komedia romantyczna, fantasy<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; font-family: Arial, Verdana;\">Czas trwania: 129 min.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4366","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"KINO KADR","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":129,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789734428.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":11,"name":"KINO KADR (Ratusz ul. Rynek 1)","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Stasz\u00f3w","city_id":1862,"zip":"28-200","addresse":"Rynek 1"}},"984":{"id":984,"title":"Tony ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tony-2026-09-27-19-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740610.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":37,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 19:20:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":21,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":37}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":284,"name":"Tony ","description":"<h2 style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Anthony Bourdain \u2013 buntownik, outsider, g\u0142os pokolenia, jeden z najbardziej znanych szef\u00f3w kuchni i jedna z najwi\u0119kszych, najbardziej charyzmatycznych osobowo\u015bci telewizyjnych. Podr\u00f3\u017cnik, pisarz, odkrywca, kt\u00f3rego miliony ludzi na ca\u0142ym \u015bwiecie pokocha\u0142y za bezkompromisowy styl, mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 do \u017cycia, szacunek do ludzi, odwag\u0119, ciekawo\u015b\u0107 \u015bwiata i autentyczno\u015b\u0107. \"Tony<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\" to historia pocz\u0105tk\u00f3w jego drogi \u2013 kim by\u0142, zanim sta\u0142 si\u0119 Anthonym Bourdainem.<\/span><\/font><span style=\"font-size: small; font-weight: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Upalne lato 1976 roku, Provincetown \u2013 miasto pulsuj\u0105ce wolno\u015bci\u0105, seksem i energi\u0105. M\u0142ody, marz\u0105cy o karierze pisarza, Tony (Dominik Sessa<\/span><span style=\"font-size: small; font-weight: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), by podreperowa\u0107 bud\u017cet, trafia na zmywak do restauracji serwuj\u0105cej owoce morza, prowadzonej przez tajemniczego szefa kuchni (Antonio Banderas<\/span><span style=\"font-size: small; font-weight: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). W intensywnej, chaotycznej, a jednocze\u015bnie niezwykle kreatywnej atmosferze Tony odkrywa swoj\u0105 pasj\u0119, powo\u0142anie i to, kim tak naprawd\u0119 jest.<\/span><\/h2><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Czas trwania: 106 minuty<\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Produkcja: USA<\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Gatunek: Dramat, biograficzny<\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\"><br><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\">Zwiastun:&nbsp;<\/font><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=IOAtrMH4wQ4<\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4342","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"KINO KADR","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":106,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789740610.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":11,"name":"KINO KADR (Ratusz ul. Rynek 1)","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Stasz\u00f3w","city_id":1862,"zip":"28-200","addresse":"Rynek 1"}},"958":{"id":958,"title":"Psi Patrol i dinozaury 2D Dubbing PL ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/psi-patrol-i-dinozaury-2d-dubbing-pl-2026-10-02-15-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788089528.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T15:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":37,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:20:00","startAt":"2026-08-30 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:30:00"},"products":[{"id":21,"name":"Bilet normalny","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":37}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":278,"name":"Psi Patrol i dinozaury 2D Dubbing PL ","description":"<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Pod