 decyzji. Brzmi jak wymarzony wyjazd? Poczekajcie do pierwszego drinka.<\/font><\/span><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\"><br><\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Czas trwania: 97 min.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Produkcja: Australia, USA<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Gatunek: Komedia<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\"><br><\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Zwiastun:&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=9a6wRnfx2mA<\/font><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4302","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"KINO KADR","c