\u00f3\u0142pracy z Jeffem Horwitzem - reportem z \"Wall Street Journal\" - stara si\u0119 ujawni\u0107 najbardziej skryte tajemnice tego pot\u0119\u017cnego portalu spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowego.<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\"><br><\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Czas trwania: 115 min.<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal;\"><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">Dramat, Biograficzny, Dokumentalny<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Produkcja: USA<\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br><\/span><\/font><\/div><div style=\"\"><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Zwiastun:&nbsp;<\/span><\/font><font color=\"#242424\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">https:\/\/www